cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MNE-RT in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "MNE-RT: real-time M/EEG signal processing"
abstract: >-
  MNE-RT is an open-source Python package for real-time M/EEG signal
  processing, built on MNE-Python and MNE-LSL. It implements the full
  closed-loop neurofeedback and brain-computer interface pipeline:
  Lab Streaming Layer acquisition, online artifact correction, neural feature
  extraction in sensor and source space, adaptive reward protocols, live
  visualisation, feedback output over LSL and OSC, and BIDS-compatible session
  saving.
type: software
version: 1.2.0
